  {
    "name": "game[description]",
    "tag": "TEXTAREA",
    "type": "textarea",
    "value": "<p><strong>Type to slash. Press Space to parry. Chase the high score.</strong></p>\n<p>Play free in your desktop browser. You need a keyboard; no download is required.</p>\n<p>Face a sword-wielding skeleton in a 2D pixel-art duel. Finish the words on screen to attack, then time your parries to stay alive. Break the skeleton's stamina to enter Slayer mode and turn correct keystrokes into a flurry of strikes.</p>\n<h2>How to play</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Type the highlighted word</strong> to swing your sword.</li>\n  <li><strong>Press Space</strong> as the enemy attacks to parry.</li>\n  <li><strong>Break enemy stamina</strong> with hits and parries to trigger Slayer mode. Type quickly and accurately during the opening.</li>\n  <li><strong>Press Esc</strong> to pause. From the pause or end screen, press <strong>R</strong> to restart or <strong>M</strong> to return to the menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Set your best score</h2>\n<p>Enter a player name, build your combo and see how far you can climb on the global Top 1000 leaderboard. Try another run and beat your personal best.</p>\n<h2>Development</h2>\n<p>Typing Hero is in active development. If you encounter a problem, please leave a comment with your browser, what you were doing and what happened. Gameplay feedback is welcome too.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://crusenho.itch.io/complete-ui-essential-pack\">Complete UI Essential Pack &mdash; Free Flat theme</a> by <strong>Crusenho</strong> (CC BY 4.0). The frame is tinted and 9-sliced in Unity.</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://kenney.nl/assets/input-prompts-pixel\">Input Prompts Pixel</a> by <strong>Kenney</strong> (CC0).</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/vt323\">VT323</a> by <strong>Peter Hull</strong> (SIL Open Font License 1.1).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These verified UI credits and licenses are included in the browser build. Attribution for the original character, environment and audio assets is still being verified.</p>"
  },
